<title>SPAIN: Spains SEPI announces new Endesa chairman.</title>
<headline>Spains SEPI announces new Endesa chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish state holding company SEPI said on Friday that Rodolfo Martin Villa is to replace Feliciano Fuster as chairman of electricity giant Endesa.</p>
</text>
